flowchart TD
  A[Disable and stop Hi Rokid] --> B[20 s scan-only baseline]
  B --> C[Start 60 s HMAC scan window]
  C --> D[Enable and launch Hi Rokid]
  D --> E[Power-cycle glasses and observe one stock reconnect]
  E --> F[Capture stock/Bluetooth logcat and optional bugreport]
  F --> G[Stop and disable Hi Rokid]
  G --> H[20 s post-stock scan]
  H --> I[Extract provisioning-GATT address and 0x9301 evidence]
  I --> J[HMAC-correlate address to scan token]
  J --> K{Unique endpoint gate}
  K -->|pass| L[Private raw endpoint handoff and sanitized public hash]
  K -->|unresolved| M[No handoff; retain bounded evidence]
  L --> N[No automatic GATT or RFCOMM connection]
